WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
- All this week to celebrate
our season three premiere,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.590
we've been asking some LA celebrities

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.053
to share their LA Top 3.

00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:08.928
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.928 --> 00:00:11.178
♪ LA Top 3 ♪

00:00:12.389 --> 00:00:14.972
(crowd cheers)

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.290
These are not your usual spots in LA,

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.900
these are spots hand selected
by friends of our show

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.810
who have spent years in this great city,

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.470
and know what they're talking about.

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:27.110
Today's Top 3 comes from
one of our favorite guests,

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.090
one of my favorite guests,

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.330
you know him as host of
"American Ninja Warrior" on NBC

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:34.390
and also "American Ninja
Warrior Junior" on Peacock.

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:35.845
It's Matt Iseman.

00:00:35.845 --> 00:00:40.845
(crowd cheering)
(Kelly cheers)

00:00:41.631 --> 00:00:43.769
- [Matt] What's up!

00:00:43.769 --> 00:00:45.766
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:45.766 --> 00:00:46.824
- Hello.

00:00:46.824 --> 00:00:47.860
I don't know if we can hug.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.065
- Virtual!
- Can we?

00:00:49.065 --> 00:00:50.932
I was like, I don't know if we can hug.

00:00:50.932 --> 00:00:52.462
- It is so nice to be here.

00:00:52.462 --> 00:00:53.817
- I love your energy.

00:00:53.817 --> 00:00:55.750
- I love you singing, by the way,

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:56.950
to somebody in the audience,

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:58.300
her first name ain't baby,

00:00:58.300 --> 00:00:59.940
it's Kelly, Ms. Clarkson,

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:03.090
- Yes, if you are (indistinct)

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:04.663
Yes, how are you?
- I just wanted to do that.

00:01:04.663 --> 00:01:05.700
- I love that.
- I'm great.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:08.617
I'm so glad, it's so nice to
be here, feeling an audience.

00:01:08.617 --> 00:01:09.450
- People.

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:10.570
- I know I've missed it so much.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:11.590
- It was weird.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.210
Yeah it was really weird, yes.
- Right?

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:14.780
- Well as host of
"American Ninja Warrior",

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:16.540
you also meet some very athletic people

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:17.524
and then people like me.

00:01:17.524 --> 00:01:21.280
So I was wondering if you
could give us your top three

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.680
places in LA to watch sports.

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:26.470
- Totally, by the way today is 22 years

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:28.147
that I've lived in LA, today.

00:01:28.147 --> 00:01:29.207
(crowd cheers)

00:01:29.207 --> 00:01:32.710
22 years, I can officially
have a beer in LA now,

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:34.540
but you looked at a lot of great places

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:37.080
like Dodger Stadium or The Forum.

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:39.086
Those are great, but
everyone knows about those.

00:01:39.086 --> 00:01:42.450
I want to tell you some places
in LA to see some LA sports.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.030
- Okay okay, wait, what's number three?

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:46.270
- Number three, Manhattan Beach.

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:48.830
Alright look, if you're in
LA, let's go to the beach,

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:51.480
let's get sandy, beach volleyball.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:52.313
- Sandy.

00:01:52.313 --> 00:01:53.954
I've never been to Manhattan Beach.

00:01:53.954 --> 00:01:55.952
- Really?
- No, I'm always working.

00:01:55.952 --> 00:01:57.243
- You should do a beach concert there.

00:01:57.243 --> 00:01:59.160
- I know, I need to go to Manhattan Beach

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:02.840
or just go for fun and
not have to work (laughs)

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:04.830
- That's kind of my
approach, going to the beach.

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:05.830
- What's number two?

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:08.970
- So number two everyone
wants to get up to Malibu,

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:10.720
but one of the great things
you go to the beach there

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.510
and you can find surfing.

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:14.680
So Topanga Beach is one
of the earliest beaches

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:15.810
you get right on Malibu.

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:18.140
You get in there, it's unbelievable.

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:19.130
You see the waves.

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:21.900
And once again, I got in, I couldn't surf.

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:22.750
I nearly drowned.

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:23.720
I got back out,

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:24.960
cracked a bottle of wine,

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:27.238
and had the time of my life.
(crowd cheering)

00:02:27.238 --> 00:02:30.870
It is awesome, it is gorgeous
and you're in Malibu Kelly.

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:33.010
- I have done that, I actually
tried to surf as well.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.170
- How'd it go?

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:36.220
- It did not go well, first
of all, getting in that thing,

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:38.081
I felt like a sausage, the wetsuit thing.

00:02:38.081 --> 00:02:40.010
- Oh that's awful.
- I was like, oh my God.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.191
- Can't they just turn
the heat up on the water?

00:02:42.191 --> 00:02:44.200
- And then also like I got out there

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:45.960
and I was so terrified of putting my arms,

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:47.243
my limbs in the water, because sharks,

00:02:47.243 --> 00:02:48.150
- Sharks, sharks.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:49.380
- So they were just like you
got to get up on the board.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:51.420
And I was like, "No, I don't."

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:54.210
Then I just like, kind
of just went in like this

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:55.110
and then just spent
some time on the beach.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.720
- I feel like that
would be a great TikTok.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:58.083
You and Charli D'Amelio surfing.

00:02:58.083 --> 00:02:59.300
- You know what?

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.290
It would be funny.
(Kelly laughing)

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:02.240
Wait, what is that?

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.320
I'm sensing a theme.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.370
Is it a beach theme?

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:05.203
What is number one?

00:03:05.203 --> 00:03:07.160
- Kelly you are very good at (mumbles)

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.140
it is a beach theme.

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:09.860
Now, if you don't know,
I host a little show

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:12.219
called "American Ninja Warrior".

00:03:12.219 --> 00:03:15.260
(crowd cheering)

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:16.520
NBC makes me do that.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.353
- I like it.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:19.600
- One of the cool things, if you go to the

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:21.750
Original Muscle Beach,
not the new one in Venice,

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:22.890
The Original Muscle beach,

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.730
right near the Santa Monica Pier.

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:26.930
There are rings out
there, there are ropes.

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:28.260
And every weekend,

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:31.680
a lot of competitors from our
show go out there and train.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:32.900
They have competitions.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.970
And if you're at all
interested in being fit,

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:37.560
you can go out there, they
will help you get into it.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:40.070
I have been banned from
attempting any of the obstacles.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:42.560
So once again, I'll be on
the sidelines with wine,

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:43.410
cheering them on.

00:03:44.332 --> 00:03:45.517
- I'll be there.

00:03:45.517 --> 00:03:47.467
Well thank you so much Matt.
- Always.

